Z||000002||ounmongk||05-05-2000||05:58 PM||||good call, DXR, but we really should try to help him out. I think the posts that should get on people's nerves are the ones coming from four-banger owners who want more power out of their cars (now I know how you guys felt when  I first got on the board, haha)<BR>Rice, look at the fiero store or maybe give Summit a call. I think the number is 1-800-230-3030, but double-check that. they should be able to get you what you need. Or you can forget the muffler and get resonator tips. (but I don't think that's not what your looking for  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )I want to redo my exhaust too, but my car's a 4cyl.We're kinda in the same boat, Rice..... good luck. ||||reg||1
