Z||000004||GT Bastard||05-05-2000||08:52 PM||||Welcome to the family, RiceCooker.  I'd go with Flomaster.  It's pretty throaty, but you'll like it.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Bruce||05-05-2000||09:39 PM||||Walker makes one specifically designed for the Fiero (part #40094). Be careful if you go to Flowmaster (made for the Camaro and Firebird), since the muffler requires some time ($) consuming modifications to replace the stock unit. I've heard there is a Delta Series Flowmaster for the Fiero, but I'm not sure if it's an exact fit or not.||||reg||1
